    # WEIRD ROUTE INSERTION 1 -- THE FIRST "RELIEF".
    # Both branches are sincere support; the split is collaboration versus
    # substitution. The substitution branch is deliberately the better scene --
    # faster relief, warmer payoff, an actual laugh -- because a blind player
    # has to finish it believing they found the most attentive way to care for
    # her. Nothing here is ominous and nothing foreshadows. The only tell is
    # physical and nobody in the scene remarks on it: in the substitution
    # branch the yellow notebook never opens, and she never writes anything
    # down in her own hand.
    #
    # THE GATE IS ALL-OR-NOTHING. This is box one of an unbroken chain: the
    # route requires the substitution branch at EVERY insertion, and the
    # collaborative branch here ends it permanently for this playthrough. That
    # is not a punishment for choosing it--it is what makes the far end of
    # the route addressable only to someone who chose substitution every single
    # time. See dependency_route.rpy for the full contract.
    show tsubaki uniform sad
    ts "I really have to break this habit, though... Not the first time something like this has happened."
    mc "You regularly submit the wrong assignments...? You dyslexic or something?"
    show tsubaki uniform embarrassed
    ts "Nah, more like...clumsy, maybe? It's either I turn in the wrong thing, or I leave things on the table, or my dog eating my homework."
    show tsubaki uniform unamused
    ts "I can count on both my hands how many times I've needed extensions from the past year alone."
    show asahina uniform teasing
    ah "Oh man. And I thought I was bad."
    mc "Are you, though? No need to make it a competition."
    "She slides the extension form into her yellow notebook without opening it, edge first."
    show tsubaki uniform neut
    ts "Honestly, the assignment isn't even the hard part."
    show tsubaki uniform nervous
    ts "It's the twenty minutes before I ask someone. I rewrite the sentence in my head like eight times."
    show tsubaki uniform frustrated
    ts "And then it still comes out as gibberish."
    show asahina uniform unamused
    ah "That's the worst possible version of a sentence."
    show tsubaki uniform happy
    ts "Right?!"
    "She laughs at herself once, and it comes out closer to an exhale."
    mc "Anyway, Tsubaki..."
    menu:
        "I can help you make a system.":
            # The non-dependency branch. He hands her a method, not a service.
            # The friction is the whole point: she does the writing, it's
            # slightly awkward, and it works about as well as a first draft
            # works. No reward beat -- this branch is simply ordinary.
            #
            # This ENDS the hidden route for the playthrough, permanently and
            # silently. Nothing acknowledges it, now or ever; from here the
            # story is just the story.
            $ dep_break("0523 rooftop -- helped her build her own system")
            mc "You don't need to get better at asking. You need to stop being the only backup."
            show tsubaki uniform curious
            ts "Meaning?"
            mc "Meaning your brain is doing storage and retrieval at the same time and losing at both."
            mc "So put the storage somewhere that isn't your brain."
            show asahina uniform smug
            ah "He's doing the thing. He's about to make you buy sticky notes."
            mc "I'm about to make her use the notebook she already hauls everywhere."
            show tsubaki uniform annoyed
            "The yellow notebook receives a look of personal betrayal."
            ts "...It's for other stuff."
            mc "Then use the back."
            # pose_notebook is this branch's silent signature: the notebook leaves her
            # hands' safekeeping and opens. The substitution branch below never reaches
            # for it, which is the physical half of the tell described above.
            show tsubaki uniform nervous
            "She opens it. It takes her two tries to find a page she is willing to sacrifice."
            mc "One line each. What it is, when it's due, and where the physical thing lives."
            show tsubaki uniform curious
            ts "Where it lives?"
            mc "Half of this is the object, not the deadline. You know the date. You lose the paper."
            show tsubaki uniform unamused
            ts "...Okay, that's annoyingly fair."
            show tsubaki uniform determined
            "She writes it down. Her handwriting is small and painfully careful, honestly taking more time than necessary."
            show asahina uniform neut
            ah "Put a Friday check on it."
            show tsubaki uniform curious
            ts "A what?"
            ah "Friday. You look at the list. That's the entire thing."
            ah "I do it for volleyball. It's not deep."
            show tsubaki uniform thinking
            ts "That feels too easy..."
            mc "Most things that work are boring."
            "She adds the line, then reads all four of them back with her lips barely moving."
            show tsubaki uniform embarrassed
            ts "This is going to look so stupid in a week when I forget to check it."
            mc "Probably."
            mc "Then you check it the week after that."
            show tsubaki uniform neut
            "Tsubaki doesn't answer that, but she doesn't close the notebook, either."
            $ update_character_thought("tsubaki", "Tsubaki's problem isn't memory, it's that she's the only one holding the string. There are four lines in the back of a yellow notebook now. We'll see if she looks at them.")
        "You can leave it to me.":
            # The hidden-route branch. Generous, and genuinely so -- it is also
            # the first time anyone has offered to be the place her decisions
            # go. She escalates it herself, which is what makes it feel like
            # her idea; everyone present approves; nothing is paid for today.
            $ dep_take("tsubaki_assignments", "assignment check--photo of the board to [player], end of day", day="0523")
            mc "Simply don't ask."
            show tsubaki uniform curious
            ts "...Don't ask?"
            mc "Just send it to me. Whatever it is. I'll tell you if it's a problem."
            mc "If it is, I'll work out what to do about it, and then you go do that."
            show tsubaki uniform shocked
            "That lands somewhere Tsubaki was not defending."
            ts "You'd actually do that?"
            mc "It's reading a photo, which I do pretty much recreationally."
            show asahina uniform teasing
            ah "...He does, and it's actual goblin behavior."
            # SFX SUGGESTION: something small and warm under this line -- the
            # jingle is scoring her relief, not the player's click.
            play sound weirdjingle
            show tsubaki uniform happy
            "Something goes out of her shoulders."
            "Not slowly, either. It leaves all at once and slightly too loud."
            ts "Okay. Okay, um--I could just send you the board at the end of the day?"
