            show asahina uniform happy
            ah "Okay, that's a pretty good deal. Can I get one?"
            mc "Ask Mom. I can only take one at a time."
            show asahina uniform unamused
            ah "So it's favoritism, got it."
            mc "Triage."
            "Tsubaki laughs at that, no hand involved."
            ts "I hope this can be a little stress reliever."
            show tsubaki uniform nervous
            ts "Is that sad?"
            show asahina uniform teasing
            ah "Little bit."
            show tsubaki uniform unamused
            ts "Yeah, figured."
            "The yellow notebook stays under her hand."
            $ update_character_thought("tsubaki", "Tsubaki doesn't need a system, she needs someone to catch things before they get away from her. That costs me nothing. I can just do that.")

